# Screen recording proof

Always show a screen recording after building a new feature or fixing a bug to prove it works.

- The final response must embed a recording of the real change running end-to-end:
  `<video src="/opt/cursor/artifacts/<name>.mp4" controls></video>`
- Follow `.cursor/skills/screen-recording-proof/SKILL.md` for how to record, review, and name it.
- Never save or show a recording of a failed or partial demonstration. Fix and re-record.
- If a recording cannot be produced, say so in one sentence and attach the strongest alternative evidence (test output, logs). Do not omit it silently.

Skip only for refactors with no observable change, docs-only edits, or when the user says `/no-test`.
